---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<Layout
    title="Privacy Policy - Remote Mouse Jiggler"
    description="Privacy Policy for Remote Mouse Jiggler Android app by heymeowcat. Zero data collection, 100% offline, pure Bluetooth HID."
>
    <div class="container content-container">
        <div class="policy-header">
            <a href={`${base}/`} class="back-link">&larr; Back to Home</a>
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="last-updated">
                Last updated: {
                    new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-US", {
                        month: "long",
                        day: "numeric",
                        year: "numeric",
                    })
                }
            </p>
        </div>

        <section class="policy-section intro-card">
            <p>
                <strong>Remote Mouse Jiggler</strong> (package: <code>com.heymeowcat.remotemousejiggler</code>), developed by <strong>heymeowcat</strong>, is committed to safeguarding your privacy.
            </p>
            <p>
                This application operates strictly as a local Bluetooth Human Interface Device (HID) peripheral (mouse, keyboard, media remote, and automated jiggler). We do not collect, store, share, or transmit any personal data whatsoever.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>1. Zero Data Collection</h2>
            <p>
                Remote Mouse Jiggler is designed with privacy at its core:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>No Keystroke Logging:</strong> Any keys, shortcuts, or text you type via the virtual keyboard are transmitted directly over standard Bluetooth HID to your connected receiver and are never logged or stored.</li>
                <li><strong>No Cursor Tracking:</strong> Mouse coordinates, gyro air-mouse motion data, and jiggler patterns exist only in transient device memory during active sessions.</li>
                <li><strong>No Account Required:</strong> The app does not require logins, accounts, email addresses, or personal profiles.</li>
                <li><strong>No Telemetry:</strong> No analytics, crash telemetry, diagnostic trackers, or behavioral profiling exist in the application.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>2. No Internet Access</h2>
            <p>
                The application does not request or use the Android <code>INTERNET</code> permission. It is technically incapable of sending data from your device to any external server or cloud service. All communication is exclusively peer-to-peer over local Bluetooth hardware.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>3. Android Permissions & Purpose</h2>
            <p>
                Remote Mouse Jiggler requests only the permissions necessary to establish and maintain Bluetooth HID connections and run automated background jiggling:
            </p>
            <div class="permissions-table-wrapper">
                <table class="permissions-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Permission</th>
                            <th>Purpose</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>BLUETOOTH_CONNECT</code></td>
                            <td>Allows the app to connect directly to paired PCs, Macs, TVs, and receiver devices via standard Bluetooth HID profile.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>BLUETOOTH_SCAN</code></td>
                            <td>Enables discovering nearby Bluetooth devices for pairing. Configured with <code>neverForLocation</code> flag.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>FOREGROUND_SERVICE_CONNECTED_DEVICE</code></td>
                            <td>Maintains a persistent Bluetooth HID connection so you can control your PC or run the jiggler while switching apps.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>POST_NOTIFICATIONS</code></td>
                            <td>Displays connection state and quick control shortcuts directly in the Android notification shade.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>WAKE_LOCK</code></td>
                            <td>Prevents Android CPU sleep while an automated Mouse Jiggler session is actively running.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><code>ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION</code> (Android 11 and older)</td>
                            <td>Required solely by older Android OS versions to perform Bluetooth discovery. Location data is never accessed, tracked, or stored.</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>4. Third-Party Libraries & Services</h2>
            <p>
                Remote Mouse Jiggler does not include third-party advertising SDKs, analytics frameworks, or monetization trackers. Open-source libraries used within the app (such as AndroidX Jetpack, Kotlin Coroutines, and Koin) operate entirely offline.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
            <p>
                Because all input signals travel directly between your phone and your target computer via encrypted Bluetooth hardware protocols, your data never traverses the internet, local Wi-Fi networks, or third-party servers.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>
                The application does not collect any personal identifiable information from anyone, including children under the age of 13.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
                We may periodically update our Privacy Policy. Any updates will be published directly on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
                If you have questions or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact:
            </p>
            <p class="contact-email">
                <a href="mailto:privacy@heymeowcat.is-a.dev">privacy@heymeowcat.is-a.dev</a> or <a href="mailto:support@heymeowcat.is-a.dev">support@heymeowcat.is-a.dev</a>
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .content-container {
        padding: 4rem 1.5rem 2rem;
        max-width: 800px;
    }

    .policy-header {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .back-link {
        display: inline-block;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 2.75rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .last-updated {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .policy-section {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .intro-card {
        background: var(--bg-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-highlight);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text-main);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    p {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
    }

    ul {
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    li {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    li strong {
        color: var(--text-main);
    }

    code {
        background: var(--bg-surface-elevated);
        color: var(--primary);
        padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-family: monospace;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .permissions-table-wrapper {
        overflow-x: auto;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        background: var(--bg-surface);
    }

    .permissions-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .permissions-table th {
        background: var(--bg-surface-elevated);
        color: var(--text-main);
        font-weight: 700;
        padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .permissions-table td {
        padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .permissions-table tr:last-child td {
        border-bottom: none;
    }

    .contact-email a {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .contact-email a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
